pytorch_model.bin

# Keep model directory structures but exclude weights
# Models should be downloaded on each machine
LLM/models/**/*.safetensors
LLM/models/**/*.bin
LLM/models/**/*.pth
LLM/models/**/*.pt
# But allow config files
!LLM/models/**/config.json
!LLM/models/**/tokenizer*.json
!LLM/models/**/*.md

# Auto-generated model status (regenerate after clone)
LLM/MODELS_README.md

# Per-run experiment artifacts and generated metadata
# W&B offline runs and logs
LLM/wandb/
wandb/
**/offline-run-*/

# Model mapping and auto-generated checkpoint folders
**/model_map.json
**/M*Checkpoint*/

